WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:17.181
Access policies are optional controls for confidential software.
Choose who can open encrypted files before publishing a private
release. They do not give permission to administer the fleet.
Open Access policies. A policy controls decryption for
confidential releases.

2
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:23.445
Choose Group and select guide-pilot. Membership determines which
devices may request keys.

3
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:30.261
The grant is recorded. Revocation stops future requests; it
cannot recall bytes already decrypted.
